 milestone scorecard + the HEADLINE DECISION. Headline questions: (1) did the
 one ALIVE oracle-distinct vehicle -- the verifier-as-DETECTOR -- become
 ACTIONABLE: did bidirectional fusion LOCALIZE the earliest step-error better
 than unidirectional + enable a useful selective-prediction abstention point
 (exp4381 detector_localization_actionable), GENUINELY (not
 position/leak/overfit; exp4382 localization_win_is_genuine)? ->
 detector_actionable_state. (2) did the detector COMPOUND as labeled traces
 accumulate (exp4385 detector_compounds)? (3) did detection GENERALIZE beyond
 FoVer (exp4386 detector_generalizes_cross_domain), or is it domain-bound
 (logged gaps)? (4) ARC north star: the new reproducible_total_levels (>=34?)
 across exp4383 (deeper high-headroom + lookahead) + exp4384 (ar25/ka59/ft09
 L2); how many NEW levels/games. Aggregate (SKIP any flagged_adversarial
 artifact; HONOR verifier_is_oracle -- a circular/execution-grounded win is
 NOT a moat). Emit verifier_thesis_state (one honest string) +
 detector_actionable_state (one of: actionable_localization_and_abstention /
 detects_but_not_actionable / open) + detector_compounds +
 detector_generalizes_cross_domain + reproducible_total_levels. Compute the
 G1-G4 publication gate via publication_gate.py. Use the robust
 aggregate-available-report-gaps helper (NO hard-block-all-False). CARRY
 verifier_is_oracle correctly (the durable exp4355 stamp fix) so this capstone
 does NOT trip CIRCULAR_MOAT_OVERCLAIM. NO gated_on.

